---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="AapkaNeta.org ki privacy policy — hum kaunsa data jama karte hain aur kaise use karte hain.">
  <style>
    .l-hero { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; padding: 44px 0; }
    .l-hero h1 { font-size: 32px; }
    .l-hero p { color: #cbd5e1; margin-top: 8px; max-width: 680px; }
    .l-block { margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .l-block h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .l-block p, .l-block li { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15px; }
    .l-block p { margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .l-block ul { margin: 10px 0 10px 22px; }
    .l-block li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .updated { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  </style>

  <div class="l-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Aakhri update: 12 October 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>1. Hum kaunsa data jama karte hain</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Koi account, login ya registration nahi</b> — site bina login ke poori tarah istemaal hoti hai, isliye hum aapka naam, email ya phone number nahi maangte.</li>
        <li><b>Analytics</b> — hum Google Analytics ka istemaal karte hain taaki ye jaan saken kaun se pages zyada dekhe jate hain. Ye aggregated, anonymous data hai.</li>
        <li><b>Correction / Contact form</b> — agar aap correction ya sampark bhejte hain, to wahi jaankari humare paas aati hai jo aap khud dete hain (naam, email, sandesh). Ye sirf jawab dene ke liye istemaal hoti hai.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>2. Data ka istemaal</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Site ko behtar banana aur technical samasyaen theek karna.</li>
        <li>Correction request par jawab dena.</li>
        <li>Hum aapka data <b>kisi teesre paksh ko bechte nahi</b> aur marketing ke liye share nahi karte.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>3. Cookies</h2>
      <p>Site ko sahi chalane aur analytics ke liye cookies istemaal hoti hain (Google Analytics). Browser settings se aap cookies band kar sakte hain — site tab bhi kaam karegi.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>4. Teesre paksh ke links</h2>
      <p>Site par myneta.info, news sites aur sarkari portalon ke links hain. Un sites ki apni privacy policy hoti hai — unke liye hum zimmedaar nahi.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>5. Bachchon ki gopaniyata</h2>
      <p>Ye site aam nagrikon ke liye hai aur jaan-boojh kar bachchon se koi personal data nahi jama karti.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>6. Badlaav</h2>
      <p>Policy me badlaav hoga to yehi page update hoga aur upar \"Aakhri update\" ki tareekh badlegi.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>7. Sampark</h2>
      <p>Privacy se jude sawalon ke liye: <a href="/contact" style="color:#fbbf24">Contact page</a> dekhein.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
